    "title": "Missing TDF renal monitoring baseline and ongoing",
    "message": "Guidelines require serum creatinine and eGFR at baseline before initiating TDF-based ART. Patient is on TDF but no renal function labs appear in the record. Without a baseline or follow-up creatinine/eGFR, TDF-related nephrotoxicity cannot be detected. The clinician's plan does not include any renal monitoring orders.",
    "issue_type": "monitoring_gap",
    "severity": "moderate",
    "recommended_action": "Order serum creatinine and eGFR to establish baseline and ongoing TDF renal safety monitoring.",
